From: PTPT52.AI <ptpt52@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: add AN7563 and AN758x natflow SRAM offload

Keep AN7563's 512-entry SRAM hash and use 8K, four-way SRAM tables on
AN7581/AN7583. Export the matching natflow table ABI, disable DRAM and
NPU flow-stat reservations, and select the ingress PPE independently
from the logical flow index, following the MT7981 dual-PPE convention.

Reserve ownership before SRAM writes, quarantine failed transactions,
and account flows through QDMA ACNT0. Mirror IPv6 source MAC slots in
all PPE banks and release references only after successful invalidation.
Serialize atomic natflow installation with PON bearer replacement and
route CPU-injected packets through their ingress PPE.

Signed-off-by: PTPT52.AI <ptpt52@gmail.com>
